{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-30T22:10:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116291741754315244"],"id":"2116291741754315244","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":101227,"like_count":749,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":42},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2116289541594071115","type":"quoted"}],"text":"iOS 27.3 beta is now launching next week, including Apple Intelligence in China as expected. Public release in December, Apple confirms. https://t.co/la6dJ0ehEy https://t.co/mzIPRbyEwd","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2116291741754315244"},{"created_at":"2026-10-30T16:51:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116211298644234708"],"id":"2116211298644234708","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":52373,"like_count":130,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2116171678736875899","type":"quoted"}],"text":"YouTube: https://t.co/7x7X0Cbdi1 https://t.co/7uqHD84ECq","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2116211298644234708"},{"created_at":"2026-10-30T14:13:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116171678736875899"],"id":"2116171678736875899","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":80181,"like_count":203,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":10},"text":"NEW: This week’s Power On podcast is out. We break down Apple’s touch MacBook Pro after going hands-on, including the OLED display, design, interface and pricing. Plus, iPhone Duo impressions, the cracked-screen controversy, and Apple’s supply problems. https://t.co/KBrJXKaJK0","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2116171678736875899"},{"created_at":"2026-10-29T23:59:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115956820372328478"],"id":"2115956820372328478","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":52,"impression_count":163088,"like_count":1348,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":71,"retweet_count":25},"text":"We’re on iOS 27.3 beta 1 watch. It was planned for Tuesday/Wednesday but never came out. Apple already said publicly that beta 1 is coming in October. Tomorrow is the last opportunity for that but who cares if it slips to next week.","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115956820372328478"},{"created_at":"2026-10-29T23:28:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115949024423584228"],"id":"2115949024423584228","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":237,"impression_count":240865,"like_count":1526,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":42},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115886855216325100","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I have no knowledge of this user’s specific case but I can tell you that influencers blaming consumers on social media is what creates situations like this. Apple’s guidance is for stores to send people to AppleCare and not deal with it in store! https://t.co/M0TetJrXBv","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115949024423584228"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2115588651031969792","3_2115588650994204672"]},"created_at":"2026-10-28T23:36:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115588654798459320"],"id":"2115588654798459320","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":91,"impression_count":77199,"like_count":466,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":9},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2085550830829412476","type":"quoted"}],"text":"No surprise that @neilcybart is being fronted as Apple’s “outside” commentator in a couple recent articles. He reliably delivers the message disguised as an “independent analyst” and goes after anyone with an actually independent perspective. https://t.co/pTAvt3H8yN https://t.co/6iuW5WdKGE","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115588654798459320"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2115556660009938944"]},"created_at":"2026-10-28T21:29:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115556701676224948"],"id":"2115556701676224948","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":31576,"like_count":200,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Just recorded this week’s Power On podcast with @chriswelch — all about the touch MacBook Pro and iPhone Duo. Stay tuned for the episode this Friday.